# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. Everything the images need is
# installed from package-lock.json inside the build, never copied from the host.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
backend/generated
backend/src/generated

# Secrets must never enter an image layer — .env.example is the only one shipped.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
.omc

# Docs and tooling have no effect on the runtime image.
*.md
!README.md
.prettierrc.json
.prettierignore
eslint.config.js
docker-compose*.yml
